                    "Tool modes: Analysis Mode (analyze current errors), Design Mode (design improved format), Implementation Mode (generate Rust code), Testing Mode (validate improvements)",
                    "How to interact with the expert personas",
                    "How personas escalate decisions",
                    "Expected workflow: Analysis → Design → Implementation → Testing",
                    "The tool improves Silica compiler error messages to be LLM-parseable (primary) and human-readable (secondary)",
